 nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-08-20\nNotes: Official UA
 I 2026 pages list tutorials\, main conference\, workshops\, and paper sub
 mission deadline.\nScope: Learning and reasoning under uncertainty\, cent
 ered on probabilistic and Bayesian modeling\, graphical models\, causal i
 nference\, approximate inference\, and decision theory. Includes Monte Ca
 rlo and variational methods\, uncertainty quantification\, sequential mod
 els\, and principled analysis of learning algorithms. Uncertainty is the 
